he prince forced to marry. Five empty years pass. The king dies; the prince ascends, recalls the guard, clears the air, and they unite.\n白狐狸王子与黑豹侍卫，自幼相伴，情根深种。侍卫始终隐藏自己的爱意，默默守护，却在王子被迫迎娶兔子公主时备受煎熬。王子为了帮侍卫\"脱单\"，亲自教他如何追求心仪之人，却在过程中不自觉地生出阵阵嫉妒，浑然不觉自己早已心动。\n比武场上，危机突至，侍卫奋不顾身救下王子，两人终于道出压抑多年的真心，彼此坦白心意。然而恋情曝光后，侍卫被迫流放异地，王子也被迫成婚，两人天各一方，空等五年。\n直至老王驾崩，王子终于登上王位。他忆起旧情，将侍卫召回宫中，解开当年的误会与隔阂，两人历经磨难，终得团圆，携手相守。","type":1,"biz_id":0}],"dynamic":"","ctime":1789559268,"copyright":3,"noReprint":false,"dimension":null,"cid":41948610865,"pages":[{"cid":41948610865,"page":1,"part":"9月16日 (2)(3)","duration":3244}],"staff":[],"tagList":[{"name":"影视剪辑","type":"old_channel","jumpUrl":""},{"name":"剪辑","type":"old_channel","jumpUrl":""},{"name":"AI","type":"old_channel","jumpUrl":""},{"name":"欧腐","type":"old_channel","jumpUrl":""},{"name":"爱情","type":"old_channel","jumpUrl":""}],"upCard":{"fans":48585,"sign":"随缘传点 学点英语 自存 有的看看脸 有的看看剧情（个人喜好向）本人只是做点翻译 爱高清视频而已 没有别的能耐","level":5,"vip":{"status":0,"type":0,"nameColor":"","subscript":false},"official":-1,"officialTitle":"","archiveCount":384},"honor":[],"argue":"","snapshots":[{"time":"2026-11-16 10:10:55","stat":{"view":4950,"danmaku":18,"reply":15,"favorite":104,"coin":11,"share":4,"like":124}},{"time":"2026-11-16 12:43:15","stat":{"view":4950,"danmaku":18,"reply":15,"favorite":103,"coin":11,"share":4,"like":124}}],"firstArchivedAt":"2026-11-16 10:10:55"},"comments":{"upperMid":"3546573669664984","allCount":15,"crawlTime":"2026-11-16 12:43:15","firstArchivedAt":"2026-11-16 10:10:55","crawls":[{"time":"2026-11-16 10:10:55","roots":13,"subs":2,"all_count":15,"complete":true,"source":"member-fulllist"},{"time":"2026-11-16 12:43:15","roots":13,"subs":2,"all_count":15,"complete":true,"source":"member-fulllist"}],"orderHot":["314162095185","317642737360","317666858128","314157088641","314156431505","314152804161","317754800624","317666769424","314161051393","314156750401","317651416480","314144434177","317642596720"],"orderTime":["317754800624","317666858128","317